                subject: "Name the settings region distinctly for screen readers",
                details: "The inner region carried a label that repeated its parent's, so a screen reader\nannounced the same name twice on the way in and told you nothing about where you\nhad actually landed.\n\n---\n\n俾設定嗰個內層區域一個唔同嘅名\n\n之前個內層區域用返同上層一樣嘅標籤，讀屏器行入去會讀兩次同一個名，等於乜都冇講到\n你究竟去咗邊。",
