                subject: "Fix the blank documentation site: it mounted on the wrong element",
                details: "The site deployed green and served a 200 with its stylesheet and bundle both\nloading, and showed nothing. index.html provides a mount point with id\n\"site-root\"; the entry point I wrote looked for \"app\", found nothing, and threw\nbefore rendering a single node. I wrote that entry against an assumption instead\nof reading the index.html another agent had written.\n\nA boot failure now renders what went wrong instead of leaving an empty page.\nNothing on screen is indistinguishable from a failed deploy, a network problem\nor scripting being switched off, and any of those sends somebody looking in the\nwrong place. Saying \"the mount point is missing\" costs a few lines and points\nstraight at the fault.\n\n個文件網站 deploy 綠色、HTTP 200、CSS 同 JS 都載得到，然後畫面一片空白。\nindex.html 個掛載點叫 \"site-root\"，但我寫嘅入口去搵 \"app\"，搵唔到就掟錯，一粒\nnode 都未畫就死咗。錯喺我憑估去寫，冇去睇隔籬個 agent 寫嘅 index.html。\n\n而家開唔到就會直接寫出「壞咗喺邊」，唔會留返塊白畫面。白畫面同「deploy 失敗」、\n「網絡有事」、「冇開 JavaScript」睇落一模一樣，任何一個都會令人查錯方向。多寫幾\n行講清楚係掛載點唔見咗，就慳返人哋好多時間。",
