        entries: [
            {
                sha: "6474fc0447d749b60bcb784a989e1420fd6b2eaf",
                shortSha: "6474fc0447",
                date: "2026-08-03T11:23:42-04:00",
                subject: "Switch local rendering to the Java engine, and say so plainly",
                details: "Records D17 and D18, which reverse two earlier decisions on the user's call.\n\nD17: local world rendering runs upstream BlueMap's Java renderer, built from the\nvendored source and driven by the app. The TypeScript mesher keeps being written\nand replaces it once it proves byte-identical output. D5 committed to a pure\nTypeScript renderer with no JVM, which is right for the end state and wrong for\nthe interval: until the mesher exists the app cannot render anything at all, and\nthe mesher is the largest and riskiest part of the whole port. Driving upstream's\nrenderer means a world renders now, and it hands the mesher an exact oracle\nrather than a plausible-looking approximation.\n\nThe cost is stated rather than buried. A JDK becomes a requirement for local\nrendering, there are two engines to maintain until the mesher lands, and the\nproject's JVM-free claim becomes conditional. The README said \"no JVM and no\nJava sidecar\" in its third paragraph; that is now false, so it has been\nrewritten rather than left to quietly mislead.\n\nD18: every implementation is ported, including the six platform adapters that\nwere excluded as meaningless outside a Minecraft server JVM. With a real JVM in\nthe product they are no longer inert, and the same build that produces the\nrenderer produces them.\n\nAlso adds a root gitignore. The Java toolchain provisions into tools/oracle/ so\nno machine-wide install is touched, and that directory is already past a\ngigabyte of Gradle and dependencies. It must never reach a commit.\n\n記低 D17 同 D18，兩個都係應用戶要求推翻返之前嘅決定。\n\nD17：本機 render 改用返上游 BlueMap 個 Java renderer，由 app 自己開。TypeScript\nmesher 照寫，寫到出到 byte 對 byte 一樣先接手。D5 話要純 TypeScript 唔要 JVM —\n講最終形態係啱嘅，但講中間呢段就錯：mesher 未寫好之前，隻 app 根本連一格都畫唔\n到。用返人哋個 renderer，第一係而家即刻畫得到，第二係順手俾咗個標準答案 mesher\n去對，好過自己寫個「睇落似樣」嘅嘢。\n\n代價照寫出嚟，唔收埋：要裝 JDK、兩個引擎都要養、「唔使 JVM」呢句變咗有條件。個\nREADME 第三段本來寫住「no JVM and no Java sidecar」，而家係假嘅，所以改咗佢，唔\n留喺度靜靜雞呃人。\n\n順手加返個 .gitignore：Java toolchain 裝喺 tools/oracle/ 度，唔郁機器上面其他嘢，\n但嗰個資料夾而家已經超過一 GB，實牙實齒唔可以 commit 入去。",
                category: "docs",
                areas: ["docs", "build"],
                files: 3,
            }
        ],
