                subject: "The app renders, and here is the proof",
                details: "Ten captures of the real running app, taken by the Playwright harness in CI at\ncommit f59ca09, run 30787162563, plus the manifest recording how they were made.\nEvery window size from 1920x1080 down to 800x600, every display scale from 100\nto 200 percent, both colour schemes. Not one is a mockup.\n\nThey show the ported viewer rendering an actual Minecraft world in 3D against\nthe remote demo server: terrain, water, biome colouring, and all four marker\nkinds at once, a POI pin, a red extrude, a cyan box and a green line. That is\nthe whole Phase A viewer port working end to end, and until an hour ago nobody\nhad ever seen it, because the window had been blank since the day it was built.\n\nAlso fixed the harness selector. It waited for `.v-application`, which Vuetify\n3.13 does not emit, so it reported a perfectly mounted app as broken and wrote a\ndiagnostic-unmounted capture next to ten good ones. A false alarm there would\nhave masked a real one later, so it now waits for `.mb-app`, the class App.vue\nactually puts on its root.\n\n十張真app嘅截圖，由 CI 入面個 Playwright harness 影，commit f59ca09、run\n30787162563，仲有份 manifest 記住點影嘅。由 1920x1080 到 800x600、由 100% 到\n200% 縮放、淺色深色都齊。冇一張係靠估或者砌圖。\n\n張張都見到個 viewer 真係喺度用 3D 畫緊個 Minecraft 世界：地形、水、生態群系顏色，\n四種 marker 一次過齊晒 — POI 針、紅色 extrude、青色箱、綠色線。呢個就係成個\nPhase A viewer port 由頭行到尾嘅樣，而一個鐘之前為止，全世界都未見過佢，因為隻\n窗由整出嚟嗰日開始就係白嘅。\n\n順手執返個 harness：佢一直等 `.v-application`，但 Vuetify 3.13 根本唔會出呢個\nclass，於是隻明明掛好晒嘅 app 俾佢當壞咗，仲喺十張好圖隔籬寫多張「未掛載」嘅診斷\n圖。呢種假警報會令日後真嘅警報冇人信，所以改成等 `.mb-app` — App.vue 真正落喺個\n根度嗰個 class。",
