        entries: [
            {
                sha: "12da79a249315e387b042c7041843c948467b8bc",
                shortSha: "12da79a249",
                date: "2026-08-03T01:05:25-04:00",
                subject: "Phase C wave 2: ResourcePack orchestrator, atlas layer, texture gallery",
                details: "Completes the resource-pack pipeline. The engine now has 820 tests, and the\nplaceholder ResourcePack that the world layer had been compiling against since\nPhase B is finally the real 397-line thing.\n\nThe orchestrator keeps upstream's five ordered phases, with an AbortSignal\nchecked at exactly the points Java checks Thread.interrupted(), and the seven\nparallel loaders collapse to Promise.all. Its texture filter is the load-bearing\npart: only textures a non-reference variable actually names ever get decoded, so\na real pack does not drag its entire texture set into memory.\n\nThe atlas layer carries the two pixel routines that had to be exact. Paletted\npermutations multiply the source alpha by the palette alpha rather than taking\neither, which is what makes dyed and oxidised blocks the right colour, and there\nis a test asserting a=128 over a palette a=64 lands on 32. Unstitch truncates\nits region coordinates instead of rounding, proven with divisors that do not\ndivide evenly, where rounding would have produced a 3x3 block at (3,3) instead\nof the correct 2x2 at (2,2). Java's getSubimage returns a view; here it is an\nexplicit copy, because pngjs has no such thing.\n\nUpstream's LinkedHashSet dedup is reproduced quirk and all: Source#equals bails\nunless the class is exactly Source, so only unknown and filter sources ever\ndedup, and two identical single-sources are deliberately kept apart.\n\nTextureGallery pins ordinal 0 to the missing texture and inserts the rest opaque\nfirst then key-sorted, which is what keeps texture indices stable across a\nre-render so already-rendered tiles keep pointing at the right thing.\n\nAlso: zipTestUtil finally has the test it was written for, and the barrel\nexported ResourcePack as a type, so nothing downstream could construct one.\n\nresource pipeline 收工，engine 而家有 820 個 test。由 Phase B 一直頂住嘅\nResourcePack placeholder，終於換成真嘅 397 行。\n\n兩段像素運算係要一絲不苟嗰啲。Paletted permutation 要將原圖 alpha 同色板 alpha\n相乘，唔係二揀一 — 染色磚同氧化銅嘅顏色就係靠呢步，所以特登寫個 test 釘死\na=128 撞 a=64 要出 32。Unstitch 要截斷唔准四捨五入，用個除唔盡嘅 divisor 嚟證：\n四捨五入會俾你 (3,3) 度一舊 3x3，正確答案係 (2,2) 度 2x2。\n\n上游個 LinkedHashSet 去重連怪癖都照抄：Source#equals 唔係正正 Source 就即刻收\n工，所以淨係 unknown 同 filter 先去到重，兩個一模一樣嘅 single source 係要分開\n擺嘅。\n\n順手補返：zipTestUtil 終於等到當初為佢而寫嘅 test；另外個 barrel 一直用\n`export type` 出 ResourcePack，即係外面淨係嗌得出個名，new 唔到。",
                category: "engine",
                areas: ["engine", "docs"],
                files: 23,
            }
        ],
