                subject: "Unbreak lint and strip a private repo link from the public tree",
                details: "Two errors were holding the whole pipeline hostage: `catch (_ex)` twice in\nDirFileSystem, where the underscore prefix does nothing because\ntypescript-eslint checks catch bindings under `caughtErrors`, not\n`argsIgnorePattern`. Both sites throw the error away anyway, so they now use a\nbare `catch {` and say what they mean. lint runs before tsc in CI, so these two\nunused variables were also hiding every real type error behind them.\n\nThe vendored regex-builder reference still wore the branding and the repository\nlink of the private repo it was copied from, in a repository that is public. It\nnow points at this project, its dead `styles.css` link is gone, and its nav\npoints at docs that actually exist.\n\n二個 unused variable 就搞到成條 pipeline 死火，underscore 前綴喺 catch 度根本\n唔work，改用 bare catch 直接乾手淨腳。順手execute埋: 隻 regex builder 由私人\nrepo 抄過嚟嗰陣連招牌都冇除，公開 repo 掛住人哋私人 repo 條link，而家改晒返\n自己個名，順便執走條死link。",
